{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">因電力故障，來往金鐘港鐵站至杜老誌道之間的電車服務，晚上暫停。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">事發後多輛電車停在沿線路軌上，運輸署派出工程車疏導交通，有工程人員到場處理。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">今次是電車連續第二日發生電力故障，周一晚一度暫停，波斯富街至北角總站東行線，及北角總站至天樂里西行線的電車服務。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.TRAM-2230_001.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026qQJnoBB98w1788275493.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.TRAM-2230_001.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-01T15:18:55.707221+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":127,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}